:Class HelpedBook
    ⍝ Wraps an NPOI IWorkbook or GemBox ExcelFile and disposes it on destruction.
    :Field Public Instance WB←⍬
    :Field Public Instance FileName←''

    ∇ new args
      :Implements Constructor
      :Access Public Instance
      FileName WB←args
      ⎕DF '[HelpedBook: "',FileName,'"]'
    ∇

    ∇ Dispose
      :Access Public Instance
      :Trap 0
          WB.Dispose
      :EndTrap
    ∇

    ∇ Cleanup
      :Implements Destructor
      Dispose
    ∇

:EndClass
